Rebuild MCMIS dashboard as a full Market-Committee MIS

Mirrors PITB's Market Committee Management Information System for Punjab
agriculture marketing — the real mandi functions beyond staff/finance:

- Fee/revenue collection per committee vs FY target (collection %, today,
  pending) + 12-month province revenue trend chart
- Licensing of registered market players: Commission Agent (Arhti), Trader
  (Beopari), Weighman (Tolaidar), Contractor (Theka), Broker (Dalal) — active,
  suspended, new-this-month, renewals due
- Daily auctions & arrivals per committee (lots, tonnage, vehicles, gate passes)
- District/division-wise collection rollup
- 10 animated KPI counters; existing staff roster + infra issues retained

Data layer (mcmisData.js): licenses, auctions, fees, revenueTrend,
districtSummary(), licenseTypeSummary(), extendedSummary(). New endpoints
/api/mcmis/{licenses,auctions,fees,revenue-trend,districts} + extended summary,
added to server.js and the browser runtime; bundle rebuilt.

Verified rendered in headless Chrome.

